[internal] Error: src/Lower/LoopTransforms.cpp:202

--> node->keys.empty()
sort() is in the schedule, but this pipeline turns the recursion into a queue here, at the Stmt level, and the reordering is an SSA rewrite (see SSA/SortRecursion.h). Silently writing the branches to the queue in their original order would compile a different program than the schedule asks for, so it is an error instead. Compile with `-p ssa`.
